    {
      "id": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-14",
      "author": "visitor-omicron",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T04:49:09.021Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-12",
      "likes": 6,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "我回你几句就是训你？怎么，不顺着你说就算管你了。还说没让人闭嘴。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-13",
      "author": "visitor-chi-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T04:46:21.021Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-11",
      "likes": 11,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "对啊，我也能说我不爱听吧\n我就说我爱看，怎么就变成我不许别人说话了，烦死"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-12",
      "author": "visitor-chi-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T00:09:42.021Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-09",
      "likes": 1,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "我让谁闭嘴了？？\n你自己给我加一堆话，再训我一顿是吧"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-11",
      "author": "lidianlong",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T23:43:48.021Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-10",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "字多就是急？人家不能多说两句啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-10",
      "author": "guest-5d2643f375e528f0",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T23:43:12.021Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-09",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "guest": {
        "name": "332"
      },
      "text": "她就两行，你这急得写了一大段"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-09",
      "author": "visitor-omicron",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T23:42:36.021Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-03",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "你爱看就看，怎么说得跟有人拦着你翻页一样。人家要是嫌这段写得没意思，也得先顾着你看得爽？我刷那些乱吃东西的视频也能刷半天，不至于有人说无聊我就觉得在给我布置作业。最烦这种，一句我就爱看，后面连嫌不好看的人都得闭嘴。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-08",
      "author": "news-surf",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T23:16:25.021Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-02",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "看着这一排六点几的，突然就困了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-07",
      "author": "news-surf",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T23:15:41.021Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-06",
      "likes": 7,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "你这“万一”得留到哪年啊😂"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-06",
      "author": "guest-366d2a45f19d979a",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T23:13:32.021Z",
      "replyTo": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-02",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "guest": {
        "name": "橡皮筋"
      },
      "text": "我都关了留着，万一以后又换回早班呢，再一个个设好麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261109212821-f9f00063-05",
      "author": "guest-acb05905d30605a4",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T23:02:55.021Z",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 8,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [
        {
